{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"深圳APEC｜外交部：APEC商務旅行卡持有人停留期延長至90天\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/SZ-APEC-261030-16.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】深圳下月舉行亞太經合組織APEC領導人非正式會議前，外交部宣布便利亞太區域商務人員往來措施。</p><p>外交部宣布，將APEC商務旅行卡持有人在華最長停留時間，由原本的60天延長至90天，由周日起實施。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:23:57.248609+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:15:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:42.071562+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T09:19:36.348215+00:00","content_hash":"77857fdd903ef55306ba87fb43f6764b98a897fa3f38821c4dc3171d316ffb53","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}